{
  "name": "HL · Sage Desk (B4)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Sage Desk\nBoss 4. One agent, five tools, five safety layers.\nTelegram (or the eval harness) → mask card numbers → paused by hand-over? → /start welcome with AI disclosure → input guardrail → Sage Desk (max iterations 6, Postgres memory tg-{chat_id} window 8) → output check → Decisions log → reply (or return to harness).\n\n**Credentials:** Telegram API; OpenAI (4 model/embedding nodes); Postgres (Supabase); Supabase; Google Sheets OAuth2.\n**Replace:** YOUR_MODEL (3 nodes); YOUR_SHEET_ID (2 nodes); YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (Tolu, for agent-error alerts); YOUR_GET_PRICE_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_GET_ORDER_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_ISSUE_REFUND_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_HANDOVER_WORKFLOW_ID (pick the B4 sub-workflows).\n**After import:** Settings → Error workflow → HL · Error alerts (B4).\n\nSheets: Decisions (time, chat_id, is_eval, message, guardrail, reply, output_check, tools_used); Handovers (session, status, issue_key, summary, at).",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 480
      },
